<title>ITALY: Italian bonds/futures closing report.</title>
<headline>Italian bonds/futures closing report.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian bonds and futures ended firmer but off day's highs seen early in the sesssion as positive sentiment returned to the market, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said they had seen little Btp selling. &quot;With prices near highs we might have expected some significant profit-taking but sellers have been very thin on the ground,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>Business was thin but the December Btp contract had a good day, touching an early session high of 126.01. The market ignored late weakness in German bunds and U.S. Treasuries.</p>
</text>
